        "content_type": "text/html",
        "body": "<div>Thanks Alex for your reply. I certainly understand the timing might not be right and you have a lot of other items in your plate as you are working towards establishing your professorship career.</div><div><br></div><div>The reason I wanted to talk is to present possibilities that our software offers. We have one of the most advanced behavioural research software solutions and seeing the possibilities can be give you new ideas or more effective way to execute your current research plan.</div><div><br></div><div>Even if your schedule is tight right now, I can circle back later when the workload slows down a bit.</div><div><br></div><div>Let me know,</div><div>Amin</div><div><br></div><div data-signature=\"true\" data-signature-id=\"7\"><div>--<br>Avicenna Research (formerly Ethica Data)<br><div><div>4109 - 295 Adelaide St W, Toronto, ON M5V 0L4, Canada</div></div>\n<div>Email: sales@avicennaresearch.com - Web: <a href=\"https://avicennaresearch.com\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://avicennaresearch.com</a><br>--</div>\n</div></div><div>\n<br><br>\n</div><div><blockquote type=\"cite\">On Tuesday, September 10, 2024 at 10:22:38 AM, Alexander R. Lucas wrote:<br><br><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Amin,<div> </div>\n<div>Thanks for your email. Apologies for not responding sooner. Your product looks great but at this time I am not in a position to adopt a new platform for my study. I will keep you in mind should I move to another stage of the current project and I have capacity to do so.</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>Best,</div>\n<div>Alex</div>\n</div>\n<br><div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\">On Tue, Sep 10, 2024 at 10:07 AM Amin Tavassolian &lt;<a href=\"mailto:amin.tavassolian@avicennaresearch.com\">amin.tavassolian@avicennaresearch.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br>\n</div>\n<blockquote><div>\n<div style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);\">Re. the ADT exercise intervention project Hello Alexander, I understand how busy you must be, but I wanted to ensure that my last message regarding Avicenna's help in the ADT exercise intervention project didn't slip through the cracks. One</div>\n<div style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);\">ZjQcmQRYFpfptBannerStart</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"> <div> <div>This Message Is From an External Sender</div>\n<div>This message came from outside your organization.</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<a href=\"https://us-phishalarm-ewt.proofpoint.com/EWT/v1/JqxBPMk!mdOsRXbJtJl5fpkXED7vRZ2ID_5IsAo4D_rDiho6-M5Kjb-wrE0Zj5CYPT7GnAnYXxgrncwx5NwGq_i5CMqtHoq5tEjSCpjGV1bWaCwDzgYGS57m8ve_U0fGWiHENNxBwcJck4fQDISOQGpCJrJuAzJURTbX$\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://us-phishalarm-ewt.proofpoint.com/EWT/v1/JqxBPMk!mdOsRXbJtJl5fpkXED7vRZ2ID_5IsAo4D_rDiho6-M5Kjb-wrE0Zj5CYPT7GnAnYXxgrncwx5NwGq_i5CMqtHoq5tEjSCpjGV1bWaCwDzgYGS57m8ve_U0fGWiHENNxBwcJck4fQDISOQGpCJrJuAzJURTbX$\" target=\"_blank\"> <div>Report Suspicious</div></a> </div>\n<div> </div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);\">ZjQcmQRYFpfptBannerEnd</div>\n<div>\n<p>Hello Alexander,</p>\n<p>I understand how busy you must be, but I wanted to ensure that my last message regarding Avicenna's help in the ADT exercise intervention project didn't slip through the cracks.</p>\n<p>One major differentiator of our work is usability of our software. Most EMA softwares have a low-quality user interface that even researchers hate it, let alone participants. We have made sure our software's user interface is easy-to-follow for both researchers to set up the study, and for participants who participate in it. In fact, in the last side-by-side comparison, our software resulted in 17% more compliance compared to a competitor who claims to have the best UI in the industry.</p>\n<p>I'd be happy to provide the details of this comparison case-study, or answer any other questions you might have.</p>\n<p>Best,<br> Amin</p>\n<p>P.S: If you do not want to hear from me, just reply back and let me know.</p>\n<span class=\"js-signatureMarker\"></span><p>--------<br> Am