        "content_type": "text/html",
        "body": "<div>Hi Alex,</div><div><br></div><div>Thank you very much for getting back to me.</div><div><br></div><div>Monday, Sep 23 from 2:00 - 2:45 PM works perfectly for me. I just created an event and invited you. I put the Google Meet link below for your convenience as well.<br><br><div><a href=\"https://meet.google.com/rqb-canu-xei\" title=\"https://meet.google.com/rqb-canu-xei\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://meet.google.com/rqb-canu-xei</a></div>\n</div><div><br></div><div>Looking forward to speaking with you.</div><div>Best,</div><div>Amin</div><div><br></div><div><blockquote type=\"cite\">On Wednesday, September 18, 2024 at 5:45:23 AM, Alexander R. Lucas wrote:<br><br><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Amin,<div> </div>\n<div>yes sure I am certainly open to hearing more about your software and offerings. Next week i have time during the following windows</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>Would 30-45 min during any of these times (all in EDT) work for you?<br>- Mon Sep 23, 1:30-3:30 PM<br>- Tue Sep 24, 1:30-2:45 PM<br>- Thu Sep 26, 10:30 AM - 12:30 PM<br>- Fri Sep 27, 11:30 AM - 12:45 PM<br>\n</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>Sincerely,</div>\n<div>Alex</div>\n</div>\n</blockquote></div><div><br></div>",
